  "aiContextParagraph": "The professional ethics hearing concerning former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo has been delayed following his refusal to attend the session. The hearing pertains to allegations involving unauthorized wiretapping. According to reports, the police have scheduled a second summons for the official. While authorities acknowledge that they cannot physically compel his attendance, they confirmed that the ethics commission's internal regulations allow for the legal process to continue in his absence. Representatives from the National Police Commission (Kompolnas) noted that incidents of individuals failing to appear at professional ethics hearings are not unprecedented within the police institution. The proceedings have now been rescheduled for the following Monday as the investigation into the alleged misconduct continues.",
